// Wave 17C-3A R4: Production HTTP ReadOps, Raw Binary Session File Serving, CRDT Records,
// Projects Info (atomic PROJECTS.jsonl), Drive mkdir (workspace-scoped), Shared Transfers,
// and Handle-Bound Resource Process Stopping.
//
// Architectural invariants:
// - ReadOps (`memory`, `usage`, `usage.calls`, `machineSessions`, `machineSession`,
//   `session.timeline`, `session.peek`/`open` place resolution) delegate 1:1 to the real
//   read-only `pion/station/packages/{readops_core,readops_local,readops_usage}` engines.
// - Zero nested `host_shim::wait` loops: archived `workspace.tar.zst` extraction is handled
//   asynchronously in `whole_daemon` via `EdgeMuxHub` (`ctx.mux_role.call_async_raw("tar.file", ...)`),
//   and `> 8 MiB` `files`/`open?raw=1` responses stream `200 OK` in 64 KiB backpressured chunks
//   via `whole_daemon`'s `AdminStreamMode` channel (constant ~64 KiB memory, never `206`).
// - ZERO fake 200 stubs: any op whose underlying live runner / outbound SSRF-safe HTTP /
//   cloud feedback / cross-station peer fan-out is not wired returns honest `501 Not Implemented`.

